{"acronym": "DRSTG-TG", "archived": null, "badges": [], "contact_point": null, "created_at": "2024-12-27T09:25:56.520000+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "Les donn\u00e9es sur la r\u00e9capitulation du segment t\u00e9l\u00e9phonie et GSM au Togo fournissent un aper\u00e7u des performances et des tendances du secteur des t\u00e9l\u00e9communications mobiles. Ces donn\u00e9es incluent le nombre d'abonn\u00e9s, la r\u00e9partition des parts de march\u00e9 entre les op\u00e9rateurs (comme Moov Africa et Togocom), les revenus g\u00e9n\u00e9r\u00e9s, les tarifs des services (appels, SMS, internet mobile), ainsi que la qualit\u00e9 de service (couverture r\u00e9seau, d\u00e9bit internet, etc.). Elles permettent de suivre l'\u00e9volution de la p\u00e9n\u00e9tration mobile, de la concurrence entre op\u00e9rateurs et de l'impact de la t\u00e9l\u00e9phonie mobile sur l'\u00e9conomie num\u00e9rique du pays.", "extras": {}, "frequency": "annual", "frequency_date": "2025-12-27T09:29:59+00:00", "harvest": null, "id": "676e72a425147391259fd69e", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2024-12-27T09:25:56.520000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2024-12-27T09:30:34.175000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2024-12-27T09:30:34.175000+00:00", "last_update": "2024-12-27T09:29:33.685000+00:00", "license": "other-open", "metrics": {"discussions": 0, "followers": 0, "resources_downloads": 35, "reuses": 0, "views": 67}, "organization": {"acronym": "INSEED", "badges": [{"kind": "public-service"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "6762b98e7156b2067b148b2b", "logo": "https://opendata.gouv.tg/s/avatars/29/9919cbb59e47a4920d8267de5255f4-original.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://opendata.gouv.tg/s/avatars/29/9919cbb59e47a4920d8267de5255f4-100.png", "name": "Institut National de la Statistique et des \u00c9tudes \u00c9conomiques et D\u00e9mographiques", "page": "https://opendata.gouv.tg/fr/organizations/institut-national-de-la-statistique-et-des-etudes-economiques-et-demographiques/", "slug": "insti